-- 7 Billion Humans (2235) --
-- 22: Number Royale --
-- author: martinez8859
-- contributor: abfipes
-- times: 8 10
-- notes: abfipes12: "myitem < 63" gives 99.015% success rate instead of 100% (and that is cheating, will need to undo that in the future) --

pickup s
a:
if myitem < 63 or
 myitem < w or
 myitem < nw or
 myitem < n or
 myitem < ne or
 myitem < e or
 myitem < se or
 s == hole:
	step s
endif
step e
jump a